    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/87ef28b39c3b828f4dc67f5296e0baf8.avif?t=1685649085\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Horror?</h2>Choose your map and try to escape. It's up to you if you want monsters chasing you or if you want a peaceful experience with no threats.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Gameplay</h2>Try playing with VHS graphics or retro style 90's graphics (I know this trope is becoming overdone but it looks cool).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere Is Everything</h2>Immerse yourself with a haunting soundtrack of over 15 unsettling dreamcore/weirdcore songs.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/feca34d3cdb2ad7234f924aabf27a37c.poster.avif?t=1685649085\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/feca34d3cdb2ad7234f924aabf27a37c.webm?t=1685649085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/feca34d3cdb2ad7234f924aabf27a37c.mp4?t=1685649085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A Note From The Developer</strong><br><br>Hi! Thanks so much for checking out my game. I think its important to be transparent with the community, so just know that I am plan on adding more content over time with free updates and no microtransactions. This game is currently just a fun little atmospheric walking simulator where you need to find multiple items to escape, hence the cheap price. There is no progression or saving. I am open to adding stuff like this is in the future if the fanbase becomes large enough. Thank you for reading!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/87ef28b39c3b828f4dc67f5296e0baf8.avif?t=1685649085\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Horror?</h2>Choose your map and try to escape. It's up to you if you want monsters chasing you or if you want a peaceful experience with no threats.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Gameplay</h2>Try playing with VHS graphics or retro style 90's graphics (I know this trope is becoming overdone but it looks cool).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmosphere Is Everything</h2>Immerse yourself with a haunting soundtrack of over 15 unsettling dreamcore/weirdcore songs.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/feca34d3cdb2ad7234f924aabf27a37c.poster.avif?t=1685649085\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/feca34d3cdb2ad7234f924aabf27a37c.webm?t=1685649085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413230/extras/feca34d3cdb2ad7234f924aabf27a37c.mp4?t=1685649085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A Note From The Developer</strong><br><br>Hi! Thanks so much for checking out my game. I think its important to be transparent with the community, so just know that I am plan on adding more content over time with free updates and no microtransactions. This game is currently just a fun little atmospheric walking simulator where you need to find multiple items to escape, hence the cheap price. There is no progression or saving. I am open to adding stuff like this is in the future if the fanbase becomes large enough. Thank you for reading!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Liminal Space. We have been expecting you. Choose your map and try to escape. It's up to you if you want monsters chasing you or if you want a peaceful experience with no threats. With an unsettling soundtrack and fun graphic options, you'll have a good time for a cheap price.",
